{"title":"The convent where the Salamancans wrote their great works","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/919926809/0/marginalrevolution~The-convent-where-the-Salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html","date":1749419013000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-225x300.jpg\" width=\"450\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-225x300.jpg 225w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/ConventSanEsteban-260x348.jpg 260w\" /></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Convento_de_San_Esteban,_Salamanca\" target=\"_blank\">Convent San Esteban</a>.  It is still there, you can just walk right in, though not between 2 and 4, when the guards have off.  Arguably the Salamancans were the first mature economists, and the first decent monetary theorists, as well as being critically important for the foundations of international law, natural rights, and anti-slavery arguments.  It is also difficult to find issues where they were truly bad.</p>\r\n<p>You can just walk right in, and you should.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html\">The convent where the Salamancans wrote their great works</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/919926809/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/919926809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/919926809/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f06%2fConventSanEsteban-225x300.jpg\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/919926809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/919926809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/919926809/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html#comment-160924900\">In reply to Bob.   Best overall country imo. Long life ...</a> <i>by Dawszein</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-convent-where-the-salamancans-wrote-their-great-works.html#comment-160924878\">Spain's miracle is that the entire country hasn't been eaten by ...</a> <i>by Bob</i></li><li><a href=\"https: